  "tour.start": "Let's play!",
  "tour.s1.title": "Goal: sink the carrier",
  "tour.s1.text": "There are two teams, blue and red. Each has a carrier that never moves. The team that brings the enemy carrier's health to zero wins the round.",
  "tour.s1.tip": "Carriers defend themselves: be careful as you close in, and attack together with your team.",
  "tour.s2.title": "Steer and shoot",
  "tour.s2.text": "W is gas, S is brake (then reverse), A and D steer. Aim with the mouse and click the left button to fire.",
  "tour.s2.tip": "The right button or the space bar switches auto fire on and off, so you do not have to hold the mouse.",
  "tour.s2.fire": "LEFT CLICK: FIRE",
  "tour.s2.space": "RIGHT CLICK · AUTO FIRE",
  "tour.s3.title": "Collect money, avoid danger",
  "tour.s3.text": "Sail over the crates and banknotes floating on the water to collect them. Sunk ships drop money too. Red barrels explode: stay away, or shoot them from a distance.",
  "tour.s3.tip": "The gold banknotes in the rock channel are worth a lot, but sentry pirates guard it.",
  "tour.s3.barrel": "BARRELS EXPLODE!",
  "tour.s3.gold": "GOLD",
  "tour.s4.title": "Upgrade and move up a class",
  "tour.s4.text": "Spend money on upgrades (keys 1–6) and, when you can afford it, move up a class (T). Your score and rank grow as you sink ships.",
  "tour.s4.tip": "When you sink you lose most of your money, and a class once your 3 lives are gone.",
  "tour.s4.button": "CLASS UP",
  "tour.s5.title": "Capture the oil rigs",
  "tour.s5.text": "There are 3 oil rigs in the middle of the map. The team that is stronger inside a rig's circle captures it. Every rig you hold pays money to everyone on your team.",
  "tour.s5.tip": "The more rigs, the more money: the rigs decide the match.",
  "tour.s5.meter": "CAPTURE",
  "tour.s6.title": "Your carrier: repairs and shop",
  "tour.s6.text": "Stop beside your own carrier to be repaired. The SHOP button (B) that appears lets you buy drones, missiles and mines.",
  "tour.s6.tip": "Press Q to lock a missile on a target, F lays a mine (T3 and up).",
